<title>5 · Real means useful — Sixty Years Later</title>
<meta name="description" content="Lem's Designer declines every question no experiment can settle and treats 'real' as a synonym for 'useful'. Sixty years later that is not a philosophical position but the working method of an industry — and the one question he ruled meaningless is the one 2026 pays people to ask.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../static/style.css">
<script src="../static/theme.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
