    44	### 4. The ladder is still graded, just off-ledger
    45	
    46	**Location:** happened — “Two things sit outside the ledger because the transposition is mine, not his… Carried across to the machines we build, the rule does not hold” (Othello probes; sparse autoencoders). Lede/meta: “the one question he ruled meaningless is the one 2026 pays people to ask.”
    47	
